  "name": null,
  "problem": "Consider the vector space ${\\text{M}}_{2}(R)$ of all $2\\times 2$ matrices over $R$ and its subset $H=\\{[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\}.$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $H$ is closed under matrix addition\n\nII. $H$ is closed under scalar multiplication\n\nIII. $H$ is a subspace of ${\\text{M}}_{2}(R)$\n\nIV. $H$ is **not** a subspace of ${\\text{M}}_{2}(R)$",
